    {
      "stepId": "intro",
      "title": "Before you begin",
      "elements": [],
      "markdownContent": "# Test the forms interface\n\nThis is a **fake community event application**. Use made-up details. Uploads and submissions stay in this local demo; no application, email or payment is sent.\n\nUse **Continue** for a blank form, or [start with sample answers](/__demo/start). You can [clear the demo answers and start again](/__demo/reset) at any time.\n\n## What to check\n\n- Header, official banner, stage banner, skip link and footer\n- Every field type, hints, errors and conditional questions\n- Repeated answers, file uploads, opening hours and address lookup\n- Review, declaration, confirmation and print layout\n\n### Try other page states\n\nThese shortcuts let you check a state without completing the whole form. Confirmation shortcuts replace this demo's saved outcome.\n\n| Page | Preview |\n| --- | --- |\n| Directory | [Local form directory](/) |\n| Draft | [Open draft mode](/forms/showcase?draft=demo) |\n| Closed | [Applications closed](/forms/showcase-closed) |\n| Error | [Form loading error](/forms/showcase-error) |\n| Missing form | [Form not found](/forms/showcase-missing) |\n| Missing page | [Page not found](/not-a-real-page) |\n| Success | [Submission received](/__demo/state/success) |\n| Success without a reference | [Reference hidden](/__demo/state/no-reference) |\n| Processing | [Still processing](/__demo/state/processing) |\n| Submission failure | [Try again](/__demo/state/failure) |\n| Payment due | [Continue to payment](/__demo/state/payment-pending) |\n| Payment complete | [Payment receipt](/__demo/state/payment-success) |\n| Payment failure | [Payment failed](/__demo/state/payment-failed) |\n| Payment could not start | [Payment unavailable](/__demo/state/payment-unavailable) |\n\n### Markdown examples\n\nThis paragraph includes **bold text**, *emphasis*, ~~strikethrough~~ and `inline code`.\n\n> This blockquote is sample guidance. It does not describe a real service.\n\n1. Enter some fake answers.\n2. Check the review page.\n   - Change an answer and return.\n   - Try the page at a narrow mobile width.\n\n#### Long content\n\n| Item | Example |\n| --- | --- |\n| Long reference | DEMOABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ |\n\n```text\nDEMO-REFERENCE-001\nThis is a sample code block.\n```\n\n##### Smaller heading\n\nSample guidance below a level-five heading.\n\n###### Smallest heading\n\nSample guidance below a level-six heading.\n\n---\n\n[Download the form JSON](/__demo/contract.json) to reuse this resolved service contract with the forms renderer.\n"
    },
